{
	"UUID": "c37615f7-f700-4600-aaf0-4ad47b524d99",
	"Name": "Okta User Authentication Overview",
	"Description": "Credential hygiene across the Okta user directory. The number cards are average elapsed times between the lifecycle timestamps on each profile, so a large \"activated to password changed\" average means users are still on the password they were onboarded with.\n\nThe three tables at the bottom are the actionable part: stale passwords, accounts nobody has used in 90 days, and accounts stuck in a locked or recovery state.",
